    "title_en": "Amplitudes separation and strong-electromagnetic phases determination in the $\\boldsymbol{J/ψ}$ decays into baryon-antibaryon pairs",
    "abstract_en": "We extract the relative phase between strong and electromagnetic amplitudes of the decays of a vector charmonium into spin-$1/2$ baryon-antibaryon pairs. Starting from a flavour-SU(3) effective Lagrangian with vector and tensor currents, we construct a parametrization in terms of partial waves coefficients. The electric and magnetic phases, the phase of the integrated complex overlap and the effective rate angle are derived from the same source amplitudes. We retain two possible solutions and both of them describe the scalar $Σ^+\\barΣ^-$ scan phase within its uncertainty, while presenting tension with several electric-magnetic production phases.",
